{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679640/extras/682d5128f59a8abf6f60d85c245d2de6.avif?t=1708528157\" width=616 height=110 /></span><br>Set forth on a mythic pixel oddysey in <strong>Mozarella Hills</strong>, a retro-inspired 2D platformer that echoes the timeless saga of Sisyphus. Players will traverse through an array of pixelated landscapes, each brimming with ancient mystery and challenges reminiscent of Greek mythology. <br><br>In <strong>Mozarella Hills</strong>, your resilience is tested against the fates as you navigate your character through enchanting deserts and dark, mysterious castles, engaging with a cast of characters that bring the lore to life. <br><br>Puzzle-solving and strategic thinking are your tools to overcome the trials set by the gods. This game is a testament to the spirit of classic platformers, providing a nostalgic blend of exploration, storytelling, and adventure. <br><br>Prepare to embark on an epic journey where each step is a brush with legend, right in the heart of <strong>Mozarella Hills</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679640/extras/e04fe572424e03cef43c3480f805f7f8.avif?t=1708528157\" width=616 height=110 /></span><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Retro style and Greek mythology.<br></li><li>Pixelated landscapes with mysteries.<br></li><li>Puzzles and strategy.<br></li><li>Mythical characters.<br></li><li>Epic challenges.</li></ul></strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2679640?t=1708528157","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2679640?t=1708528157","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1708528157","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati